OL,3,AUS strikes Iranian island ahead of
OL,4,Amidterm elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has launched strikes on Iran's
OL,7,FQeshm Island in the Strait of Hormuz,
OL,8,FUS officials have told CBS, the BBC's
OL,9,FUS partner.
OL,11,FThe officials described the strikes as
OL,12,Flimited and said they were in response
OL,13,Fto Iran's Islamic Revolutionary Guard
OL,14,FCorps (IRGC) firing on a US aircraft.
OL,16,FIranian state news agency Irna reported
OL,17,Fseveral explosions on Qeshm on Monday.
OL,18,FThe IRGC did not comment, but said its
OL,19,Fforces had shot down two US MQM-170
OL,20,Freconnaissance drones south of the
OL,21,Fisland as well as a US MQ-9 drone over
OL,22,Fan area east of the Strait of Hormuz.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
