OL,3,AUS strikes Iranian island ahead of
OL,4,Amidterm elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC has contacted US Central
OL,7,FCommand (Centcom) for comment on the
OL,8,Fstrikes, which came ahead of the US
OL,9,Fmidterm elections.
